#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:1
msgid "How Gramlot works"
msgstr "Come funziona Gramlot"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:5
msgid ""
"You write a page as a Python class. Gramlot turns it into a live interface "
"in the browser and keeps it in step with the page's values. JavaScript pages"
" work the same way."
msgstr ""
"Scrivi una pagina come classe Python. Gramlot la trasforma in un'interfaccia"
" viva nel browser e la tiene allineata ai valori della pagina. Le pagine "
"JavaScript funzionano allo stesso modo."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:9
msgid "<a id=\"gc-505-005\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:11
msgid "005 · Four ideas"
msgstr "005 · Quattro idee"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "Idea"
msgstr "Idea"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "In one sentence"
msgstr "In una frase"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "**Page**"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "The class you write. Its `main(root)` method builds the interface."
msgstr ""
"La classe che scrivi. Il suo metodo `main(root)` costruisce l'interfaccia."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "**Source**"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "The tree of elements that `main` builds: HTML, SVG and components."
msgstr "L'albero di elementi costruito da `main`: HTML, SVG e componenti."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "**Data**"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "The values the interface shows and edits, kept in a separate tree."
msgstr ""
"I valori che l'interfaccia mostra e modifica, tenuti in un albero separato."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "**Logic**"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md
msgid "The code that runs when a value changes or the user clicks."
msgstr "Il codice che gira quando un valore cambia o l'utente fa clic."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:22
msgid ""
"A fifth piece, the **server**, delivers the page to the browser. You rarely "
"touch it: an adapter plugs it into Django, Flask, FastAPI or Uvicorn, or "
"exports the page as a file that needs no server at all."
msgstr ""
"Un quinto pezzo, il **server**, consegna la pagina al browser. Raramente lo "
"tocchi: un adapter lo collega a Django, Flask, FastAPI o Uvicorn, oppure "
"esporta la pagina come file che non richiede alcun server."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:26
msgid "<a id=\"gc-505-010\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:28
msgid "010 · A complete page"
msgstr "010 · Una pagina completa"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:44
msgid "Type `Ada` in the field and the paragraph shows `Hello, Ada`."
msgstr "Scrivi `Ada` nel campo e il paragrafo mostra `Hello, Ada`."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:46
msgid ""
"`root.div`, `pane.input` and `pane.p` build the **Source**: one method per "
"element."
msgstr ""
"`root.div`, `pane.input` e `pane.p` costruiscono la **Source**: un metodo "
"per elemento."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:47
msgid ""
"`person.name` lives in the **Data**. The field writes it, the paragraph "
"reads it."
msgstr ""
"`person.name` sta nei **Data**. Il campo lo scrive, il paragrafo lo legge."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:48
msgid ""
"`^.name` means \"follow `name`\": when it changes, the paragraph updates by "
"itself. You never look up or edit DOM elements."
msgstr ""
"`^.name` significa \"segui `name`\": quando cambia, il paragrafo si aggiorna"
" da solo. Non cerchi né modifichi mai elementi del DOM."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:51
msgid "<a id=\"gc-505-015\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:53
msgid "015 · Why Source and Data are separate"
msgstr "015 · Perché Source e Data sono separati"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:57
msgid ""
"Source says **what is on screen**; Data says **which values it works with**."
" The same value can appear in many places, and each place updates when the "
"value changes. Loading a record means writing Data, not rebuilding the "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"La Source dice **cosa c'è sullo schermo**; i Data dicono **con quali valori "
"lavora**. Lo stesso valore può comparire in più punti, e ognuno si aggiorna "
"quando il valore cambia. Caricare un record significa scrivere nei Data, non"
" ricostruire l'interfaccia."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:61
msgid "<a id=\"gc-505-020\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:63
msgid "020 · Where code runs"
msgstr "020 · Dove gira il codice"

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:67
msgid ""
"**In Python, on the server:** `main` builds the Source, and methods you "
"expose answer calls from the browser."
msgstr ""
"**In Python, sul server:** `main` costruisce la Source, e i metodi che "
"esponi rispondono alle chiamate del browser."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:69
msgid ""
"**In the browser:** bindings, formulas, controllers and the `Logic` class "
"react to Data changes and user events."
msgstr ""
"**Nel browser:** binding, formule, controller e la classe `Logic` reagiscono"
" ai cambiamenti dei Data e alle azioni dell'utente."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:72
msgid ""
"A page exported without a server has no Python: everything runs in the "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Una pagina esportata senza server non ha Python: tutto gira nel browser."

#: ../docs-source/docs/public/505-how-gramlot-works.md:74
msgid "<a id=\"gc-505-025\"></a>"
msgstr ""

